%% Retrieval keeps Qdrant structural metadata while hydrating canonical content from PostgreSQL.

flowchart TD
    A([User query])
    B{Greeting or blank?}
    C[Return greeting or empty result<br/>without retrieval]
    D{Needs clarification?}
    E[Ask clarification<br/>without retrieval]
    F[Complete or rewrite query<br/>from conversation context]
    G[Embed or prepare hybrid query]
    H[Initial filtered retrieval]
    I[Hard filters<br/>approved + published + student audience]
    J[(Qdrant candidates<br/>score + structural payload)]
    K[Read postgres_chunk_id]
    L[(PostgreSQL canonical content)]
    M[Hydrate content while preserving<br/>candidate structural metadata]
    N[Structural expansion]
    O[Hit child item<br/>add logical parent]
    P[Hit parent item + list query<br/>add direct children]
    Q[List-intent query<br/>optionally add siblings]
    R[Hit split<br/>add related split neighbors]
    S[Deduplicate by chunk_key]
    T[Sort by source order]
    U[Optional rerank]
    V[Apply context budget]
    W[Build citations from canonical content<br/>and page ranges]
    X([RetrievalResult])

    A --> B
    B -->|yes| C
    B -->|no| D
    D -->|yes| E
    D -->|no| F --> G --> H
    I --> H
    H --> J --> K --> L --> M --> N
    N --> O
    N --> P
    N --> Q
    N --> R
    O --> S
    P --> S
    Q --> S
    R --> S
    S --> T --> U --> V --> W --> X

    J -. metadata retained .-> Y[logical_item_key + parent_item_key<br/>split_index + split_count<br/>chunk_index/source_order<br/>heading_path + item_path<br/>item_marker + item_level<br/>block_type + legal_unit_type]
    L -. canonical content only .-> M
    Z{{Do not expand entire Parent<br/>when one item branch is enough}} -. budget rule .-> V
